        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 28
    },
    {
      "text": "Two dark eyes anchor the snout. The short shoulder plane separates from the wing; I will distribute unequal pale spots along the left shoulder, leaving dark intervals.",
      "kind": "try",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 7020,
      "afterStroke": 28
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 32
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 32
    },
    {
      "text": "The spots read at whole view, but the first four drift toward a tidy row. Offset sizes and heights will break that rhythm on the other wing.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 7020,
      "afterStroke": 32
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 36
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 36
    },
    {
      "text": "The outer spots remain small against a broad dark disc. A few interior marks at varied intervals will describe the surface without lining every edge.",
      "kind": "try",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 6500,
      "afterStroke": 36
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 40
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 40
    },
    {
      "text": "Interior spots create a turn toward the tail. The right inner wing is quieter, so I will add a looser cluster there, then test the head highlight alone.",
      "kind": "try",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 7280,
      "afterStroke": 40
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 44
    },
    {
      "text": "The head needs a focal light stronger than the spot pattern. I will try one short 8px loaded oil stroke first and inspect its actual visibility.",
      "kind": "try",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.25
      },
      "duration": 6760,
      "afterStroke": 44
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 45
    },
    {
      "text": "The 8px light is visible but reads as a narrow scratch. A 15px loaded stroke beside it will test a broader plane with the same pigment and load; this is layered paint, not a controlled calibration.",
      "kind": "try",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.25
      },
      "duration": 9360,
      "afterStroke": 45
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 46
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 46
    },
    {
      "text": "The broader light reads as a small snout plane at whole view. I will keep it and add only tiny eye reflections, plus two subdued flank turns.",
      "kind": "keep",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.25
      },
      "duration": 7020,
      "afterStroke": 46
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 50
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 50
    },
    {
      "text": "Tiny eye reflections barely register at whole view; the snout plane carries focus. Four off-axis spots will loosen the symmetry before I leave the animal quiet.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 6760,
      "afterStroke": 50
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
