      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 54
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 54
    },
    {
      "text": "The ray now has enough pattern. Sparse broken sand ripples will give the lower space scale while leaving the tail unobstructed.",
      "kind": "try",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.75
      },
      "duration": 6000,
      "afterStroke": 54
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 58
    },
    {
      "text": "The ripples stay low contrast. A few soft olive seagrass gestures in the lower left will counter the tail without enclosing it.",
      "kind": "try",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.75
      },
